  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 18th level, you can open yourself to the psychic emanations of others and take on some of their wounds to allow them to recuperate from the scars events have left on them. You can replicate the effects of greater restoration on a target if you are in contact with them for ten minutes and you are both staying still.</p><p><a href=\"https://dnd-wiki.org/wiki/Empath_(5e_Class)\">Source: Empath by Axis, co-authored by Ghostwheel</a> (CC BY-SA 3.0). See the module's AUTOMATION.md for what is automated and how rules are interpreted.</p>",
